==English==

===Etymology===
{{rfe|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|chemistry|lang=en}} a [[substance]] that, in [[solution]] or when [[molten]], [[ionize]]s and [[conduct]]s [[electricity]]
# {{context|physiology|lang=en}} any of the various [[ion]]s (such as [[sodium]] or [[chloride]]) that [[regulate]] the [[electric charge]] on [[cell]]s and the [[flow]] of [[water]] across their [[membrane]]s

